            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Bagel Meter 1.5.1

- Friends and computers that only have the Claude desktop app signed in now say so ("No numbers: Claude app only") instead of showing a blank. Signing in to Claude Code on that computer adds the numbers.
- Windows helper: says the same during setup, with the one line to install Claude Code.
]]></description>
